========================================================================================================================
VERDICT -- k01
========================================================================================================================
  The law computes.  Q_2 = q(y_e) a_0^(3/2)/sqrt(G M_sun) with q = -0.2552 (canonical) / -0.2096 (alt),
  giving Q_2 = -2.006e-26 / -2.185e-26 s^-2.  Nothing is fitted: M_sun and the local circular speed are the
  only inputs and neither carries a stellar mass-to-light ratio, so d log Q_2 / d log Upsilon = 0 exactly.

  AGAINST INTEREST: this is ~7x the order of magnitude of the published ephemeris bound.  On the
  operative modified-gravity arm the framework therefore inherits the same Solar-System liability that
  Blanchet & Novak identified for MOND generally.  The exponential kernel does NOT escape it.
